      "definicion_pragmatica": "Some verbs are followed by -ing (enjoy, avoid, mind, finish, keep, consider, stop). Others take 'to + verb' (decide, hope, learn, agree, plan, promise, offer, forget, remember). After prepositions, always -ing (good at drawing, afraid of flying).",
      "tabla": {
